            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Trump Tells Fannie, Freddie to Buy $200 Billion of Mortgage Debt",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Trump announced the move on Thursday in a social media post, saying \u201cThis will drive Mortgage Rates DOWN, monthly payments DOWN, and make the cost of owning a home more affordable.\u201d  Mortgage-backed securities rallied relative to Treasuries on the news, while mortgage-linked stocks including Rocket Cos. Inc. and LoanDepot, Inc. rose.  Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac, government-sponsored enterprises that the US bailed out during the 2008 financial crisis, have already been increasing their holdings of mortgage bonds.",
